{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant</strong>, <strong>Water</strong>, and <strong>Grow</strong> your way to the top as a magic flower pot to make your Grandma the #1 Gardener in the World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Grandma used to be world renown for her extravagant gardening skills back in her prime. But like with all things, time has changed that. Missing the energy that she had in her youth, but not the passion, she ordered<i>\u00a0you!</i>\u00a0A magical, living flower pot to help her garden get back in top shape to win flower shows all around the world once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your garden in this turn-based roguelite, planting and swapping around your wide array of crazy flora to get the most out of your garden. Discover unique interactions, interesting abilities, and utilize plant actions to create the highest quality yield you can. Dig up the roots of the past and seed the future in <strong>Grandma's Garden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122780?t=1766727412","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122780/0aac2b932841330ec1e80f8904433de57ce10fc3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766727412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122780/ffd182a569ffd35c9a7155596b65117f152cb7b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766727412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122780/ffd182a569ffd35c9a7155596b65117f152cb7b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766727412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant</strong>, <strong>Water</strong>, and <strong>Grow</strong> your way to the top as a magic flower pot to make your Grandma the #1 Gardener in the World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Grandma used to be world renown for her extravagant gardening skills back in her prime. But like with all things, time has changed that. Missing the energy that she had in her youth, but not the passion, she ordered<i>\u00a0you!</i>\u00a0A magical, living flower pot to help her garden get back in top shape to win flower shows all around the world once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your garden in this turn-based roguelite, planting and swapping around your wide array of crazy flora to get the most out of your garden. Discover unique interactions, interesting abilities, and utilize plant actions to create the highest quality yield you can. Dig up the roots of the past and seed the future in <strong>Grandma's Garden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Shrimp Made Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122780/bf507a5cc4231f35e5f8e01d5b9ce9e8ce8ff4b2/header.jpg?t=1766727412","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122780/1406437058/7c1422131fc95abfaaf6a786cb1d4bdb3216045c/1761367811/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762273729","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4122780/1406437058/7c1422131fc95abfaaf6a786cb1d4bdb3216045c/1761367811/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762273729","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile